{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"instancetype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"identifier","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","text":"NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A string that uniquely identifies the source in the style to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which it is added.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"identifier"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"source’s contents and other metadata.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"configurationURL"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An initialized raster tile source."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"},"metadata":{"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterStyleLayer":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNRasterStyleLayer","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" is a style layer that renders georeferenced raster"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"imagery on the map, especially raster tiles."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrasterstylelayer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"title":"addSource:","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a new source to the current style."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addSource:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterTileSource","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies raster image tiles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A raster tile source is added to an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. Use a raster style layer to control the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appearance of content supplied by the raster tile source."}],"title":"MLNRasterTileSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"}}}